WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:08.181
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and hopefully
you got a chance to see the Walking Dead Comic

00:00:08.181 --> 00:00:09.510
Con panel I uploaded.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:15.550
The trailer they showed at that panel is the
one you guys have all probably seen.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.580
AMC is really nice about posting it immediately.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:23.500
The movie’s that were there like Avengers
2 and Batman vs Superman, they don’t release

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.500
those clips.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.500
I have no idea why, but this video is going
to be a breakdown of the Season 5 Trailer.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.500
The Walker Shit has hit the fan.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.470
Just in case any of you found me during comic
con or you're just now finding me.

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:31.210
I do weekly Walking Dead videos.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.210
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:35.710
After the breakdown I’ll announce the winner
of the giveaway.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:40.489
So they pick up right in that last moment
of the Season 4 finale, rick’s final line

00:00:40.489 --> 00:00:41.770
before it cut to the credits.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:46.620
But they have that crazy Inception trailer
music that a lot of people have been using.

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.040
The bwaah sound.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:50.450
I think the Godzilla trailer did the same
thing.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.050
It’s just meant to put you into a state
of anxiety.

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:54.730
And I say mission accomplished.

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:57.550
On the plus side they cranked the lighting
up.

00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:01.770
They shot the finale scene in there in almost
complete darkness.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.899
I actually had to scoot up to my tv to distinguish
who was who.

00:01:04.899 --> 00:01:09.049
It looks like they tear gas the train car
before storming in to subdue everyone.

00:01:09.049 --> 00:01:12.320
But from the looks of it, everyone just bolts
the minute they get the chance.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:17.149
All in the first few minutes of episode 1.

00:01:17.149 --> 00:01:19.189
That table Rick sees as he hits the ground.

00:01:19.189 --> 00:01:23.539
I think it’s safe to say that’s a body
being carved up, just like you’d carve a

00:01:23.539 --> 00:01:24.630
side of beef.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:25.630
More steaks for the grill.

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:28.689
Unless you want ribs.

00:01:28.689 --> 00:01:32.909
Gareth has that cool creepy monologue where
he starts speechifying his “new way of life”.

00:01:32.909 --> 00:01:36.649
The actor, Andrew J West, did that interview
on the Talking Dead special where he said

00:01:36.649 --> 00:01:41.659
Gareth has this new philosophy about what
life in the apocalypse can be.

00:01:41.659 --> 00:01:45.659
He made it sound really creepy and at the
time they had not confirmed everyone at Terminus

00:01:45.659 --> 00:01:46.659
were practicing cannibals.

00:01:46.659 --> 00:01:49.419
But I think that’s exactly what the “new
way of life is”.

00:01:49.419 --> 00:01:54.840
And this trough that everyone gets tied to
look like what you’d slice someone’s throat

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.995
over so they can collect all the blood when
it pours out of you.

00:01:56.995 --> 00:02:07.849
It looks pretty much like Bob fast talks the
shit out of Gareth into Eugene’s cure and

00:02:07.849 --> 00:02:08.990
Washington, DC.

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:14.150
It jump cuts generic Terminus shots until
Rick is with Baby freaking Judith.

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:15.500
Reunion Time.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:23.110
Which means Tyreese and Carol did make it
inside Terminus.

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.270
Then we see them on the road again with the
weapons cache.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:28.209
You didn’t think they’d just drop that
story bit.

00:02:28.209 --> 00:02:30.540
A hidden arsenal of automatic weapons.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:37.050
Rick’s tearing down a Terminus poster foreshadowing
the fall of Terminus.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:41.099
I love how Rick looks like Mel Gibson in Road
Warrior in this slow motion shot.

00:02:41.099 --> 00:02:45.010
Which is funny, because they showed footage
from the new Mad Max movie at comic con too.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:49.280
It wasn’t super clear earlier, but here
you can definitely tell they’re inside a

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.500
church.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:56.280
Since Gareth is the only person with them
it looks like they’ve left Terminus, so

00:02:56.280 --> 00:03:11.300
the trailer is jumping forward and backward
through the first couple of episodes.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:15.739
This firehose Walker repellant isn’t at
Terminus, but the thing that grabs my eye

00:03:15.739 --> 00:03:19.510
is Tera just casually sitting off to the side.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.629
It might not be her, but it’s definitely
not a walker.

00:03:21.629 --> 00:03:24.739
It’s just someone there to enjoy the water
show.

00:03:24.739 --> 00:03:28.590
Lauren Cohan teased that in the premiere we
get to see people who aren’t badasses get

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:33.140
to be badasses and based on Bob Stookey going
all michonne on this Walker, I’m guessing

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.550
she was referring to him.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:41.890
He’s come a long way from when Daryl almost
pushed him off that roof.

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:45.739
This shopping mall pit to hell is nice twist
on the Walkers falling from the ceiling early

00:03:45.739 --> 00:03:46.739
in season 4.

00:03:46.739 --> 00:03:49.819
All the water reminds me of the Governor’s
pirahna walker head fishtank.

00:03:49.819 --> 00:03:53.849
Glenn Mazzara said that they developed a lot
of new looking styles of walkers we hadn’t

00:03:53.849 --> 00:03:56.939
seen before and this guy here look pretty
new.

00:03:56.939 --> 00:04:00.519
Loving the Carl and Michonne team up.

00:04:00.519 --> 00:04:03.579
I’m hoping she teaches him to use her sword
at some point.

00:04:03.579 --> 00:04:05.650
It looks like she’s modified it to be double
ended.

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.049
Which is just awesome.

00:04:07.049 --> 00:04:11.549
This night time shot of the Church is probably
the one we’ve been seeing them in all these

00:04:11.549 --> 00:04:12.549
scenes.

00:04:12.549 --> 00:04:15.609
Rick talks about not going anywhere without
the rest of the survivors and it jumps back

00:04:15.609 --> 00:04:16.670
to Terminus.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:20.989
Back in the church Sasha says ‘you show
up and three of us are gone’.

00:04:20.989 --> 00:04:24.969
She’s talking about Abraham, Rosita and
Eugene joining the group last season.

00:04:24.969 --> 00:04:26.430
She didn’t meet them till Terminus.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:30.770
But the ones so far that are gone are Beth,
Lizzy and Mika.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:35.160
And here’s where all hell breaks loose at
Terminus.

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:37.150
Just look at all the walkers and the flames.

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:38.729
I just love this explosion.

00:04:38.729 --> 00:04:44.580
I can’t imagine how many barrels of gasoline
it took to get a flame that big.

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:55.849
Here it just looks like Carol covered herself
in Mud on approach to Terminus.

00:04:55.849 --> 00:04:57.400
I don’t think this is a new cast member
or anything.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:02.610
Everyone is kind of freaking out about this
Glenn Baseball bat scene at Terminus just

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:03.610
because of the comics.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.419
I won’t spoil what happens in the comics,
but it’s a pretty big WTF.

00:05:06.419 --> 00:05:09.919
I don’t think he dies, just because he’s
in all these other scenes in the trailer that

00:05:09.919 --> 00:05:16.050
look like they happen later in the story.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:19.370
The baseball bat scene looks like it’s from
when they first get yanked up to that trough

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:23.919
when Bob Stokey stops them from getting all
their throats slit.

00:05:23.919 --> 00:05:28.030
They will have a rotating cast this season
though, I’ll explain that later.

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:31.389
Here’s the first look at Seth Gilliam as
Father Gabriel.

00:05:31.389 --> 00:05:35.110
I know the minute they announced he was cast
everyone wondered if he was playing Gabriel

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:37.060
in the comics.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.510
They confirmed it during the Comic Con panel.

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:42.410
So I’m guessing all the church scenes we’ve
seen are from his church.

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:47.550
The real twist is that it looks like he didn’t
take Beth, she hasn’t been in any of the

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:51.729
church scenes and she shows up with a different
group of people later in the trailer.

00:05:51.729 --> 00:05:55.830
I love how many of these random shots are
of Rick using the machine gun.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:58.849
Let’s just agree to call him machine gun
Rick this year.

00:05:58.849 --> 00:06:07.949
So 
this shot is of the hospital they’ve been

00:06:07.949 --> 00:06:08.949
filming at all year.

00:06:08.949 --> 00:06:12.400
It seems like based on the number of days
they’ve spent shooting there, Beth is going

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:14.030
to be there for a long time.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:17.710
No idea where it’s located on the map.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:22.810
This is one of the new cast members who I’m
just going to call Lady Cop or Asshole Lady

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:23.810
Cop.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:27.840
Her real life name is Christine Woods, but
we don’t know what her character’s name

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:28.840
is yet.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:31.770
Or if it ties into the comics.

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:35.530
They’re the ones behind the crosses.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:39.539
But Scott Gimple said even though they invoke
a lot of imagery from the saviors in the comics.

00:06:39.539 --> 00:06:41.879
They’re not the saviors.

00:06:41.879 --> 00:06:44.789
So that Lady Cop isn’t like a Lady Negan.

00:06:44.789 --> 00:06:54.000
Even though the idea of a gender bent Negan
sounds exciting.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:07:01.590
Beth’s storyline is supposed to be pretty
substantial and take place away from the rest

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:03.200
of the survivors, at least for a while.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:07.120
So I’m guessing that hospital she’s at
is the home base of the cross people, whatever

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:08.259
their group is called.

00:07:08.259 --> 00:07:11.250
And just to comment on the whole Terminus
escape.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:16.460
It seems like based on the way the scenes
in the trailer were cut.

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:20.570
Rick and the group get Gareth to buy into
the Washington DC Cure story, so he let’s

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.000
them go to pursue it.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.729
But Rick turns them around so they don’t
have to leave anyone behind and they grab

00:07:26.729 --> 00:07:30.580
the weapons cache and let all the walkers
in and blow the place to hell.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:36.192
Gareth is a cast regular though, so it seems
like he gets Rick to spare him and let him

00:07:36.192 --> 00:07:37.192
travel with them.

00:07:37.192 --> 00:07:40.260
So he’s going to be the Littlefinger of
the group, for Game of Thrones fans.

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:43.810
If you don’t watch that show, just think
of him as a person no one trusts and who is

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.450
a super creeper.

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:49.840
But let me know what your favorite part of
the trailer is and who do you think Lady Cop

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:53.139
is who’s smacking Beth around?

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:57.659
Walking Dead is back October 12th and yes
I will be doing weekly videos just like I

